# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and on checkout. Ends the
# mixed CRLF/LF blob drift that creeps in from Windows autocrlf checkouts — drift
# that makes file-guard and linters report false changes in CI. `text=auto`
# leaves binary files alone. Matches the org-standard .gitattributes used across
# Lost-secuirty repos (e.g. testing-kits).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit (also covered by the rule above): shell scripts and git hooks stay LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
